cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these tools, please cite them as below."
title: "verification-docs: documentation for a portfolio of verification tools that refuse to guess"
abstract: >-
  The front door for a set of small verification tools built around one rule: a verdict you cannot
  check is not a verdict, and undetermined is never a pass. Covers the three-valued verdict contract,
  what an explicit-state check does and does not prove, and how the tools compose.
authors:
